#ASSERT `s 22(3) the Secretary of State may impose this requirement on the claimant` NOTHING `work preparation requirement` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2) as a regulative rule: both requirements are owed; imposing both fulfils it, imposing one leaves the other owed (the Act fixes no time)
