-- (5)(b) as a regulative rule, time 0 being the first day: imposing another requirement on time 50 or on time 90 (the last day)
-- is a breach by the Secretary of State; on time 91 (the day after) it is not; waiting to time 90 leaves the rule open, to time 91 fulfils it
#TRACE `s 24(5)(b) the Secretary of State shall not impose another requirement during the 13 weeks` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 13(1) the Secretary of State` DOES `s 24(5)(b) imposes another requirement` AT 50

